## 2. Detail Fungsi AI (`AIInferenceFunctions`)

Berdasarkan `grep` inventaris fungsi pada `ai/inference/*.py` (44 definisi terdeteksi):

| Fungsi | Berkas | Baris | Peran |
|---|---|---|---|
| `run_pipeline` | `pipeline.py` | 101 | Orkestrasi 5 fase: preprocessing, inference, postprocessing, gradcam, artifact_composition |
| `predict` | `segmentation.py` | 98 | Inferensi segmentasi + TTA (5 orientasi) + threshold |
| `postprocess_mask` | `postprocessing.py` | 26 | Close/open, area filter, hole fill, smoothing |
| `measure_mask` | `postprocessing.py` | 49 | Hitung `area_pixels`, `area_ratio`, bounding box |
| `generate_gradcam` | `gradcam.py` | 99 | Grad-CAM pada `decoder.blocks.4.conv2.0` |

Fungsi pendukung yang tidak dimodelkan terpisah (wajar disederhanakan): `prepare_image` (`preprocessing.py:15`), `smooth_contours` (`postprocessing.py:12`), `resize_binary_mask` (`postprocessing.py:44`), `count_forward_passes` (`segmentation.py:43`), `_predict_scale` (`segmentation.py:56`), `_restore_orientation` (`segmentation.py:31`).

Konstanta fase pipeline (bukti alur): `PHASE_PREPROCESSING`, `PHASE_INFERENCE`, `PHASE_POSTPROCESSING`, `PHASE_GRADCAM`, `PHASE_ARTIFACT_COMPOSITION` (`pipeline.py:22-26`). Konstanta service-side: `_STEP_UPLOADING_RESULTS`, `_STEP_COMPLETED` (`analysis_service.py:46-47`).

