## 4. Pemetaan Entitas Basis Data

### 4.1 `analyses` — subset diagram vs migrasi

**Diagram (20 atribut):** `id, user_id, status, current_step, progress_percent, original_image_path, original_filename, binary_mask_path, segmentation_overlay_path, segmentation_status, area_pixels, area_ratio, gradcam_heatmap_path, gradcam_overlay_path, gradcam_status, summary_text, error_code, error_message, created_at, completed_at, updated_at`.

**Migrasi `001_create_analyses_and_storage.sql:14-65`:** `id, user_id, status, original_image_path, original_filename, original_mime_type, original_width, original_height, binary_mask_path, segmentation_overlay_path, segmentation_status, area_pixels, area_ratio, bounding_width_pixels, bounding_height_pixels, gradcam_heatmap_path, gradcam_overlay_path, gradcam_target_layer, gradcam_method, gradcam_config_version, model_architecture, model_version, model_config_version, model_input_size, model_threshold, tta_enabled, postprocessing_enabled, summary_text, error_code, error_message, created_at, completed_at, updated_at`.

**Migrasi `002_add_ai_pipeline_metadata.sql:3-6`:** `model_checkpoint_sha256, tta_scales, tta_orientations, gradcam_status`.

**Migrasi `003_add_analysis_progress.sql:6-7`:** `current_step, progress_percent`.

**Kesimpulan:** Diagram adalah subset ilustratif. Kolom metadata reproduktibilitas (`model_checkpoint_sha256`, `tta_scales`, `gradcam_target_layer`, `postprocessing_enabled`, dll.) dan dimensi (`original_width/height`, `bounding_*`) tidak ditampilkan agar diagram tidak padat. Skema lengkap → ERD.

### 4.2 `doctor_profiles` — subset diagram vs migrasi

**Diagram (8 atribut):** `id, user_id, full_name, primary_specialty, hospital, education, experience, bio`.

**Migrasi `004_create_doctor_profiles.sql:10-47`:** `id, user_id, full_name, phone, birth_date, city, profession_category, academic_title, primary_specialty, subspecialty, clinical_focus, hospital, department, clinical_role, years_experience, practice_address, str_number, is_verified, bio, education, experience, created_at, updated_at` (22 kolom).

**Kesimpulan:** Diagram subset; 15 kolom tidak ditampilkan. Skema lengkap → ERD.

